{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13954","headline":"晚投江泽浦即事呈柳兵曹泥 · 耿湋","name":"晚投江泽浦即事呈柳兵曹泥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落日过重霞，轻烟上远沙。\n移舟冲荇蔓，转浦入芦花。\n断岸迂来客，连波漾去槎。\n故乡何处在，更道向天涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}